    <description><![CDATA[<h3 id="font-weight와-font-style-naming">font-weight와 font-style naming</h3>
<ul>
<li>100 - Thin (Hairline)</li>
<li>200 - Extra Light (Ultra Light)</li>
<li>300 - Light</li>
<li>400 - Normal</li>
<li>500 - Medium</li>
<li>600 - Semi Bold (Demi Bold)</li>
<li>700 - Bold</li>
<li>800 - Extra Bold (Ultra Bold)</li>
<li>900 - Black (Heavy)</li>
</ul>]]></description>
